<title>USA: Sheffield holders approve name change.</title>
<headline>Sheffield holders approve name change.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Medical Technologies Inc shareholders voted to change the company's name to Sheffield Pharmaceuticals, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The stock symbol will remain the same.</p>
</text>
